## Svelte 5 Runes Quick Reference

```svelte
<!-- Props (replaces export let) -->
<script>
  let { title, items = [] } = $props();
</script>

<!-- Reactive state (replaces let x = ...) -->
<script>
  let count = $state(0);
</script>

<!-- Derived values (replaces $: x = ...) -->
<script>
  let doubled = $derived(count * 2);
</script>

<!-- Effects (replaces $: { ... }) -->
<script>
  $effect(() => {
    console.log('Count changed:', count);
  });
</script>

<!-- Events (replaces on:click) -->
<button onclick={() => count++}>Click</button>

<!-- Snippets (replaces <slot>) -->
{@render children?.()}
```

