## Component System

- **UI Library**: shadcn-svelte components
- **Styling**: TailwindCSS utility classes
- **Touch targets**: Minimum 44x44px for mobile interfaces
- **Accessibility**: Follow WCAG 2.1 AA guidelines

### shadcn-svelte Integration Notes

- **Path Aliases**: Configure `@/Components/ui` in `vite.config.js` to match Laravel structure (not SvelteKit's `$lib`)
- **Form State**: shadcn components require manual form binding with Inertia's `useForm()` (see `developing-gotchas.mdc`)
- **SSR**: Some components use browser APIs; wrap in `onMount` if SSR is enabled
- **Component Location**: Install to `resources/js/Components/ui/` (not `src/lib/components`)

---

## Pre-Commit Checklist

- [ ] No SvelteKit imports (`$app/`, `+page`, `+layout`)
- [ ] Using Svelte 5 runes (`$state`, `$derived`, `$props`, `onclick`)
- [ ] Controllers return `Inertia::render()` not JSON (for pages)
- [ ] Form validation in Form Request class
- [ ] Business logic in Service class
- [ ] Authorization checks present
